<title>ESTONIA: TALLINN WATER TO ISSUE 20 MLN KROONS CPS.</title>
<headline>TALLINN WATER TO ISSUE 20 MLN KROONS CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn Water will issue 20 million kroons worth of commercial papers on August 12, Hansapank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The three-month paper will have a yield of 6.8 percent, Ulo Kallas, Hansapank's interest rate products manager, told Reuters.</p>
<p>This 20 million kroon issue follows another three-month issue worth 50 million kroons which will be on offer from August 6 and will also have a yield of 6.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
